656
02:06:44,819 --> 02:06:51,139
Metads for making confirmas about parameters fall into one of two categories.

657
02:06:53,159 --> 02:06:57,619
The first is estimate the value of the population parameter of interest.

658
02:06:58,599 --> 02:07:03,059
The second is test the hypothesis about the value of the parameter.

659
02:07:24,851 --> 02:07:29,851
In testing the hypothesis, we are seeking an answer to the question,

660
02:07:29,851 --> 02:07:34,851
does the population parameter satisfy a specified condition?

